## Overview

The Financial Reset API helps users manage debt, plan hardship relief, and track spending. It provides endpoints for:
- Creating and managing debt accounts
- Comparing hardship options (forbearance, deferment, settlement)
- Analyzing payment strategies (avalanche, snowball, balance transfer)
- Tracking spending and budgets
- Setting and monitoring financial goals

**Base Features:**
- Real-time debt analysis
- Hardship plan recommendations
- Payment strategy comparison
- Financial health scoring
- Spending analytics

**Current Status:** Production Ready
**API Version:** v0.10.1
**Total Endpoints:** 41

