## Base URL & Environment

### Production
```
https://api.financialreset.com/v1
```

Use this for all production requests.

### Staging (Testing)
```
https://staging-api.financialreset.com/v1
```

Use staging for testing before production. Data resets monthly in staging.

### Rate Limiting

- **Limit:** 1,000 requests/hour per API key
- **Headers returned:**
  - `X-RateLimit-Limit: 1000`
  - `X-RateLimit-Remaining: 987`
  - `X-RateLimit-Reset: 1715030400`

If you exceed limits:

```json
{
  "error": "RATE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED",
  "message": "You have exceeded your rate limit. Try again in 1 hour.",
  "status": 429
}
```

Request higher limits by contacting support@financialreset.com

